    },
    "body": "Context:\n- Upstream github.com/Autumn-27/norma went closed-source and the repository is no longer publicly accessible, so fresh clones can no longer resolve artex's core dependency from VCS.\n- The Go module proxy still serves the final open-source release v0.4.3 (origin commit 320ae32989da97dd91469bb89164cbfe87d83d5d, tagged 2026-09-30).\n\nChanges:\n- Restore the complete norma v0.4.3 source tree (210 files) from proxy.golang.org into ./norma as a nested module with permissions kept.\n- Add replace github.com/Autumn-27/norma => ./norma to go.mod so builds resolve the dependency locally instead of the inaccessible upstream.\n- Drop the now-unneeded norma proxy checksums from go.sum via go mod tidy.\n\nValidation:\n- go mod tidy\n- go build ./...\n- go build ./... in norma/",
